# Converted from Fossil .fossil-settings/ignore-glob.
#
# Notes on the translation:
#   * Fossil globs match the full repo-relative path (root-anchored) and the
#     "*" wildcard crosses "/" directory separators. Git's "*" does NOT cross
#     "/", but for a "dir/*" pattern git excludes any matched subdirectory
#     wholesale, so the net set of excluded files is identical.
#   * Patterns containing a "/" are already root-anchored in git, so they are
#     copied verbatim.
#   * "no.cron" and "pending-*.cron" are root-anchored in Fossil; a leading "/"
#     is added so they do not also float into subdirectories under git.

[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

